Today is my first day at the office.
I step outside from the apartment.
It is the month of January in Kochi.
It is a very pleasant morning.
I am going to the office.
I call an auto-rickshaw.
The auto-rickshaw arrives quickly.
I get into the vehicle.
We are going to Infopark.
There is heavy traffic on the roads of Kochi.
I look outside.
I see many shops.
I like Kochi city very much.
I have a laptop in my bag.
I have great happiness.
The auto-rickshaw reaches in front of the office.
I give eighty rupees to the driver.
I walk to the software company.
